# Log level
logging.level.root=INFO
logging.level.com.niranjana=DEBUG

# ✅ File size limit (VERY IMPORTANT)
logging.logback.rollingpolicy.max-file-size=10MB

# ✅ Keep old logs (backup files)
logging.logback.rollingpolicy.max-history=7

# ✅ Total size cap (all logs together)
logging.logback.rollingpolicy.total-size-cap=100MB

# ✅ File name pattern (rolling)
logging.logback.rollingpolicy.file-name-pattern=logs/order-service-%d{yyyy-MM-dd}.%i.log
   
                
Startup Order (VERY IMPORTANT)
-------------------------------
1. Eureka Server (8761)
2. User Service (8103)
3. Product Service (8104)
4. Cart Service (8105)
5. API Gateway (8107)                                